Licensing notice

This distribution retains the licenses and authorship notices present in its
source components. No new blanket license grant is inferred for files that
lack an explicit grant.

* src/frame.cpp, src/map.cpp, and src/mappoint.cpp retain GPL-3.0-or-later
  headers. The full GPL version 3 text is in LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt.
* SLAM-book-derived framework code retains Xiang Gao's authorship notices.
  The upstream MIT notice is in LICENSES/slambook2-MIT.txt. The explicit
  GPL notices above have not been removed or overridden.
* third_party/fbow retains its MIT license and source provenance.
* cmake/FindGlog.cmake retains its Google/Ceres BSD-style license in full.
* Official calibration-derived content is subject to the dataset authors'
  terms; see LICENSES/Hilti-calibration.txt.

See docs/LICENSING.md for the file-level redistribution uncertainties.
A maintainer must confirm the license grant for unmarked H2 code and resolve
legacy notice ambiguity before representing this as a fully cleared public
open-source release. This notice does not replace third-party licenses.
